    "A heart is waiting on a ring just above. Take it and one mistake stops being the end of the run — you get to carry on from where you fell. They keep coming every eight rings, you can hold three at once, and the ring carrying one never has a hazard on it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Auf dem Ring direkt darüber wartet ein Herz. Nimm es, und ein Fehler ist nicht mehr das Ende des Laufs — du machst dort weiter, wo du gefallen bist. Sie kommen alle acht Ringe, du kannst drei gleichzeitig halten, und der Ring mit einem Herz hat nie einen Gefahrenbogen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A heart is waiting on a ring just above. Take it and one mistake stops being the end of the run — you get to carry on from where you fell. They keep coming every eight rings, you can hold three at once, and the ring carrying one never has a hazard on it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el anillo de arriba te espera un corazón. Cógelo y un error deja de ser el final de la partida: sigues desde donde caíste. Aparecen cada ocho anillos, puedes llevar tres a la vez y el anillo que lleva uno nunca tiene peligro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un cœur attend sur l’anneau juste au-dessus. Prends-le et une erreur cesse d’être la fin de la partie — tu repars d’où tu es tombé. Ils reviennent tous les huit anneaux, tu peux en porter trois à la fois, et l’anneau qui en porte un n’a jamais d’arc dangereux."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すぐ上のリングにハートが待っています。取れば、一度のミスがランの終わりではなくなり、落ちた場所から続けられます。8リングごとに現れ、同時に3つまで持てます。ハートのあるリングには危険な弧は決して置かれません。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hemen yukarıdaki halkada bir kalp var. Onu alırsan bir hata turun sonu olmaktan çıkıyor — düştüğün yerden devam ediyorsun. Sekiz halkada bir geliyorlar, aynı anda üç tane taşıyabiliyorsun ve kalp taşıyan halkada asla tehlike yayı olmuyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
