    "From now on you cannot rest on a ring. A shrinking arc around it counts you down, and its last third turns red as a warning. When it runs out the orb launches itself — it does not kill you, but it chooses the moment instead of you." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ab jetzt kannst du auf einem Ring nicht mehr verweilen. Ein schrumpfender Bogen zählt herunter, sein letztes Drittel wird zur Warnung rot. Läuft er ab, startet die Kugel von selbst — sie tötet dich nicht, aber sie wählt den Moment statt dir."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From now on you cannot rest on a ring. A shrinking arc around it counts you down, and its last third turns red as a warning. When it runs out the orb launches itself — it does not kill you, but it chooses the moment instead of you."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A partir de ahora no puedes descansar en un anillo. Un arco que se encoge hace la cuenta atrás y su último tercio se vuelve rojo como aviso. Cuando se acaba, la esfera sale sola: no te mata, pero elige el momento en tu lugar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À partir de maintenant tu ne peux plus rester sur un anneau. Un arc qui rétrécit décompte, et son dernier tiers passe au rouge en guise d’avertissement. À la fin, la sphère part toute seule — elle ne te tue pas, mais elle choisit le moment à ta place."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これからはリングの上で休めません。縮んでいく弧がカウントダウンし、最後の3分の1が警告として赤くなります。尽きるとオーブは自分から飛び出します。死にはしませんが、タイミングを選ぶのはあなたではなくなります。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bundan sonra bir halkada dinlenemiyorsun. Çevresindeki küçülen yay geri sayıyor, son üçte biri uyarı olarak kırmızıya dönüyor. Süre bitince küre kendiliğinden fırlıyor — seni öldürmüyor ama anı senin yerine o seçiyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From this level on, if the orb flies off the screen, you lose the attempt." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ab diesem Level verlierst du den Versuch, wenn die Kugel aus dem Bildschirm fliegt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From this level on, if the orb flies off the screen, you lose the attempt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A partir de este nivel, si el orbe sale de la pantalla, pierdes el intento."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À partir de ce niveau, si l'orbe sort de l'écran, l'essai est perdu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このレベルからは、オーブが画面の外に出るとミスになります。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bölümden itibaren top ekrandan çıkarsa deneme yanar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
