    "I make Orbeon on my own, and someone choosing to chip in is what makes the next update worth writing. Premium is yours as well — consider it the least I can do. It follows your iCloud account, so it's there on your other devices too." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ich mache Orbeon allein, und wenn jemand etwas dazugibt, lohnt sich das nächste Update. Premium gehört dir ebenfalls — das Mindeste, was ich tun kann. Es hängt an deinem iCloud-Account und ist auch auf deinen anderen Geräten da."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I make Orbeon on my own, and someone choosing to chip in is what makes the next update worth writing. Premium is yours as well — consider it the least I can do. It follows your iCloud account, so it's there on your other devices too."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hago Orbeon yo solo, y que alguien decida aportar es lo que hace que valga la pena escribir la próxima actualización. Premium también es tuyo: es lo menos que puedo hacer. Va con tu cuenta de iCloud, así que también estará en tus otros dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Je fais Orbeon tout seul, et quand quelqu'un participe, ça donne envie d'écrire la mise à jour suivante. Premium est à toi aussi — c'est la moindre des choses. Il suit ton compte iCloud, donc il est là sur tes autres appareils aussi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orbeonは一人で作っています。誰かが支えてくれることが、次のアップデートを書く理由になります。プレミアムもあなたのものです。iCloudアカウントに紐づくので、ほかの端末でも有効です。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orbeon'u tek başıma yapıyorum ve birinin destek olmayı seçmesi, bir sonraki güncellemeyi yazmaya değer kılan şey. Premium da senin — en azından bunu yapabilirim. iCloud hesabınla birlikte geliyor, diğer cihazlarında da açık olacak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you'd like to support the developer." : {
