    },
    "That name is taken — pick another" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Name ist vergeben – wähle einen anderen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ese nombre ya está en uso — elige otro"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce nom est déjà pris — choisis-en un autre"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "その名前は使われています。別の名前を選んでください"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu ad alınmış — başka bir tane seç"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ads are off from today. I make Orbeon on my own, and this goes straight into the next levels, characters and music." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ab heute keine Werbung mehr. Ich mache Orbeon allein, und das hier fließt direkt in die nächsten Level, Charaktere und die Musik."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ads are off from today. I make Orbeon on my own, and this goes straight into the next levels, characters and music."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los anuncios se acabaron desde hoy. Hago Orbeon yo solo, y esto va directo a los próximos niveles, personajes y la música."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fini les pubs à partir d'aujourd'hui. Je fais Orbeon tout seul, et ça part directement dans les prochains niveaux, les personnages et la musique."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今日から広告はオフです。Orbeonは一人で作っていて、これは次のレベル・キャラクター・音楽にそのまま使わせてもらいます。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reklamlar bugünden itibaren kapalı. Orbeon'u tek başıma yapıyorum; bu destek doğrudan yeni bölümlere, karakterlere ve müziğe gidiyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arc starts green: on your first lap it can't hurt you. The green melts away from both ends, and once it's gone the arc turns red and burns. Leave before that." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Bogen startet grün: In der ersten Runde kann er dir nichts anhaben. Das Grün schmilzt von beiden Enden weg, und sobald es weg ist, wird der Bogen rot und brennt. Verschwinde vorher."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The arc starts green: on your first lap it can't hurt you. The green melts away from both ends, and once it's gone the arc turns red and burns. Leave before that."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El arco empieza verde: en la primera vuelta no puede hacerte nada. El verde se consume por ambos extremos y, en cuanto se acaba, el arco se pone rojo y quema. Vete antes."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'arc commence en vert : au premier tour il ne peut rien te faire. Le vert se consume par les deux bouts, et dès qu'il a disparu l'arc devient rouge et brûle. Pars avant."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "弧は緑から始まります。最初の1周は当たっても平気です。緑は両端から溶けていき、なくなった瞬間に赤くなって燃えます。その前に離れてください。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yay yeşil başlar: ilk turda sana bir şey olmaz. Yeşil iki ucundan erir, bittiği an yay kırmızıya döner ve yakar. Ondan önce oradan ayrıl."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The champion orb cannot be bought — it is only won." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Champion-Kugel ist nicht käuflich – sie wird nur gewonnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El orbe de campeón no se compra: solo se gana."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'orbe du champion ne s'achète pas, il se gagne."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "チャンピオンオーブは購入できません。勝ち取るだけです。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Şampiyon küresi satın alınamaz — yalnızca kazanılır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The colours are swapped in this level. The ring itself is red and harmless — it is the WHITE arc that burns you now. Everything you learned about red does not apply here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In diesem Level sind die Farben vertauscht. Der Ring selbst ist rot und harmlos — es ist der WEISSE Bogen, der dich jetzt verbrennt. Alles, was du über Rot gelernt hast, gilt hier nicht."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The colours are swapped in this level. The ring itself is red and harmless — it is the WHITE arc that burns you now. Everything you learned about red does not apply here."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En este nivel los colores están intercambiados. El anillo es rojo e inofensivo: ahora es el arco BLANCO el que te quema. Nada de lo que aprendiste sobre el rojo sirve aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans ce niveau les couleurs sont inversées. L’anneau lui-même est rouge et inoffensif — c’est l’arc BLANC qui te brûle désormais. Tout ce que tu as appris sur le rouge ne s’applique pas ici."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このレベルでは色が入れ替わっています。リング自体は赤くて無害で、あなたを焼くのは白い弧です。赤について学んだことはここでは通用しません。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bölümde renkler yer değiştirdi. Halkanın kendisi kırmızı ve zararsız — artık seni BEYAZ yay yakıyor. Kırmızı hakkında öğrendiğin her şey burada geçersiz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first %lld levels are completely ad-free" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die ersten %lld Level sind komplett werbefrei"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los primeros %lld niveles no tienen anuncios"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les %lld premiers niveaux sont entièrement sans pub"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最初の%lldレベルは広告なし"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "İlk %lld bölüm tamamen reklamsız"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gate" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Tor"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La puerta"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le portail"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゲート"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kapı"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gate stays locked until every star on the map is collected — landing on it does nothing until then. And if you fall here, the whole level restarts with all the stars back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Tor bleibt verschlossen, bis jeder Stern auf der Karte eingesammelt ist — darauf zu landen bringt bis dahin nichts. Und wenn du hier fällst, startet das ganze Level neu und alle Sterne sind zurück."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The gate stays locked until every star on the map is collected — landing on it does nothing until then. And if you fall here, the whole level restarts with all the stars back."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La puerta sigue cerrada hasta recoger todas las estrellas del mapa: aterrizar en ella no sirve de nada hasta entonces. Y si caes aquí, el nivel entero se reinicia con todas las estrellas de vuelta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La porte reste verrouillée tant que toutes les étoiles de la carte ne sont pas ramassées — s’y poser ne sert à rien avant. Et si tu tombes ici, tout le niveau recommence avec toutes les étoiles de retour."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マップ上のスターをすべて集めるまでゲートは開きません。着いても何も起きません。そしてここで落ちると、レベル全体が最初からやり直しになり、スターも全部戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Haritadaki bütün yıldızlar toplanmadan kapı kilitli kalıyor — üstüne konsan da açılmıyor. Ve burada düşersen bölüm sıfırdan başlıyor, toplanan yıldızların hepsi geri geliyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the journey of light" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "die Reise des Lichts"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "el viaje de la luz"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "le voyage de la lumière"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ひかりの旅"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ışığın yolculuğu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The orb orbits a ring. Tap anywhere to launch it toward the next ring." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Kugel umkreist einen Ring. Tippe irgendwo, um sie zum nächsten Ring zu schleudern."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El orbe gira alrededor de un anillo. Toca en cualquier parte para lanzarlo al siguiente anillo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'orbe tourne autour d'un anneau. Touchez n'importe où pour le lancer vers l'anneau suivant."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オーブはリングの周りを回ります。どこかをタップして次のリングへ飛ばそう。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Küre bir halkanın çevresinde döner. Bir sonraki halkaya fırlatmak için herhangi bir yere dokun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The real ad plays here in release builds." : {

    },
    "Theme" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Theme"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tema"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thème"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テーマ"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tema"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is a second gate beside the path, and it is RED. It looks like a way out and it is not — touching it throws you back to the start of the level and every star you had collected goes back too. Red has meant one thing since the very first level, and it still does here. Only the green gate finishes the level." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neben dem Weg steht ein zweites Tor, und es ist ROT. Es sieht aus wie ein Ausgang und ist keiner — es zu berühren wirft dich an den Anfang des Levels zurück, und jeder gesammelte Stern geht ebenfalls zurück. Rot bedeutet seit dem allerersten Level eine Sache, und hier ebenso. Nur das grüne Tor beendet das Level."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There is a second gate beside the path, and it is RED. It looks like a way out and it is not — touching it throws you back to the start of the level and every star you had collected goes back too. Red has meant one thing since the very first level, and it still does here. Only the green gate finishes the level."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hay una segunda puerta junto al camino, y es ROJA. Parece una salida pero no lo es: tocarla te devuelve al principio del nivel y todas las estrellas que habías recogido vuelven también. El rojo ha significado una sola cosa desde el primer nivel, y aquí también. Solo la puerta verde completa el nivel."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il y a une seconde porte à côté du chemin, et elle est ROUGE. Elle ressemble à une sortie sans en être une — la toucher te renvoie au début du niveau et toutes les étoiles ramassées repartent avec. Le rouge veut dire la même chose depuis le tout premier niveau, et ici aussi. Seule la porte verte termine le niveau."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "道の脇に2つ目のゲートがあり、それは赤です。出口のように見えますが違います。触れるとレベルの最初に戻され、集めたスターもすべて戻ります。赤は最初のレベルからずっと一つのことを意味してきました。ここでも同じです。レベルを終わらせるのは緑のゲートだけです。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yolun yanında ikinci bir kapı var ve KIRMIZI. Çıkış gibi duruyor ama değil — dokunmak seni bölümün başına atıyor ve topladığın bütün yıldızlar da geri gidiyor. Kırmızı ilk bölümden beri tek bir şey demek, burada da aynı şeyi diyor. Bölümü yalnızca yeşil kapı bitiriyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the name shown on the world ranking." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Name erscheint in der Weltrangliste."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este nombre aparece en la clasificación mundial."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce nom apparaît dans le classement mondial."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この名前が世界ランキングに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu ad dünya sıralamasında görünür."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the name shown on the world ranking. It is chosen once and cannot be changed later." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Name erscheint in der Weltrangliste. Er wird einmal gewählt und kann später nicht geändert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este es el nombre que aparece en la clasificación mundial. Se elige una vez y no se puede cambiar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C'est le nom affiché dans le classement mondial. Il est choisi une seule fois et ne peut plus être modifié."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "世界ランキングに表示される名前です。一度だけ設定でき、あとから変更はできません。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dünya sıralamasında görünecek ad budur. Bir kez seçilir, sonradan değiştirilemez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This level has one big star instead of three small ones, and it is worth four. It sits off the easy line on purpose: reaching it costs you a detour." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In diesem Level gibt es statt drei kleiner Sterne einen großen, und er zählt vier. Er liegt absichtlich abseits der bequemen Linie: Ihn zu erreichen kostet dich einen Umweg."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This level has one big star instead of three small ones, and it is worth four. It sits off the easy line on purpose: reaching it costs you a detour."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este nivel tiene una estrella grande en vez de tres pequeñas, y vale cuatro. Está fuera de la línea fácil a propósito: llegar a ella te cuesta un desvío."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce niveau a une grande étoile au lieu de trois petites, et elle en vaut quatre. Elle est volontairement à l’écart de la ligne facile : l’atteindre coûte un détour."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このレベルには小さなスター3つの代わりに大きなスターが1つあり、4つ分の価値があります。わざと楽な線から外してあります。取りに行くには回り道が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bölümde üç küçük yıldız yerine tek bir iri yıldız var ve dört ediyor. Kolay hattın dışında duruyor, bilerek: ona ulaşmak seni yoldan saptırıyor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This level is built upside down: the orb starts at the top and the gate is at the bottom. Nothing else changes — only the direction you are used to." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Level steht kopf: Die Kugel startet oben, das Tor ist unten. Sonst ändert sich nichts — nur die Richtung, die du gewohnt bist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This level is built upside down: the orb starts at the top and the gate is at the bottom. Nothing else changes — only the direction you are used to."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este nivel está del revés: la esfera empieza arriba y la puerta está abajo. No cambia nada más, solo la dirección a la que estás acostumbrado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce niveau est construit à l’envers : la sphère démarre en haut et la porte est en bas. Rien d’autre ne change — seulement le sens auquel tu es habitué."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このレベルはさかさまに作られています。オーブは上から始まり、ゲートは下にあります。変わるのは慣れた向きだけです。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bölüm baş aşağı kuruldu: küre yukarıda başlıyor, kapı aşağıda. Başka hiçbir şey değişmiyor — yalnızca alıştığın yön."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This level is timed! Reach the gate before the countdown hits zero." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Level ist auf Zeit! Erreiche das Tor, bevor der Countdown abläuft."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "¡Este nivel es contrarreloj! Llega a la puerta antes de que el contador llegue a cero."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce niveau est chronométré ! Atteignez le portail avant la fin du compte à rebours."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この面は時間制限あり！カウントがゼロになる前にゲートへ。"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu bölüm süreli! Geri sayım sıfırlanmadan kapıya ulaş."
          }
        }
      }
    },
